message: "If you use this model or its scorecard, please cite it as below."
title: "My BTC Cycle Model"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Euthymia686"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered, publicly graded model of Bitcoin's halving cycle: a projection fan built from the
  model's own past forecast errors, a Cycle Heat Score, and a cycle band. Versions are hash-locked and
  timestamped before any result, every forecast is graded in public against a plain power-law benchmark,
  and kill criteria are fixed in advance. Model ranges, not predictions; not financial advice.
